{"id": "EUVD-2026-101245", "enisaUuid": "d5993878-31df-320f-bca6-caa11383a8a0", "description": "we-mp-rss through 1.5.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the /api/v1/wx/tools/export/download endpoint that allows unauthenticated attackers to download export archives because its authentication dependency is commented out. Attackers can supply an mp_id and guessable timestamp-based export filename to retrieve archives under data/docs, and set delete_after_download=true to delete them.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T14:16:55", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T18:05:57", "baseScore": 6.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/SyP4L62oGl", "https://github.com/rachelos/we-mp-rss/blob/v1.5.3/apis/tools.py#L321-L376", "https://github.com/rachelos/we-mp-rss", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/we-mp-rss-through-1.5.3-missing-authorization-via-export-file-download-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-h2vr-gxjh-m386", "CVE-2026-110617"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.64, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "78023a68-9aaf-33db-9af4-d5eae47760b4", "product": {"name": "we-mp-rss", "vendor": {"name": "rachelos"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.5.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0d21f438-ffd9-35ac-82ed-67ff0195dc1b", "vendor": {"name": "rachelos"}}], "isExploited": false}